<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#FuzzyTimeInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#FuzzyTemporalEntity> .
<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#FuzzyTimeInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#TimeInterval> .
<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#FuzzyTimeInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A fuzzy time interval represents an interval whose at least one temporal bound is uncertain or imprecise."@en .
<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#FuzzyTimeInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un intervalle temporel flou représente un intervalle au moins une des bornes temporelles sont incertaines ou imprécises."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#FuzzyTimeInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fuzzy time interval"@en .
<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#FuzzyTimeInterval> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Intervalle temporel flou"@fr .
