<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#LandmarkRelationChange> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#Change> .
<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#LandmarkRelationChange> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A change on a landmark relation is a change of state of this relation (appearance, disappearance)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#LandmarkRelationChange> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un changement sur la relation entre repères est une modification d'état de cette relation (apparition, disparition)."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#LandmarkRelationChange> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Change on a landmark relation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/PeGazUs#LandmarkRelationChange> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "changement sur la relation entre repères"@fr .
